{"seq":2,"slug":"market-cap-weighting","title":"市值加权与替代加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/market-cap-weighting","wordCount":2414,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"市值加权与替代加权\">市值加权与替代加权</h1><blockquote>\n<p>市值加权的数学基础、等权重、基本面加权、最小方差加权、Smart Beta 与 Factor Tilt 的完整对比。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>加权方法是&quot;被动&quot;与&quot;主动&quot;之间的分水岭：它决定你究竟在系统性暴露哪一种风险因子。市值加权把权重交给市场共识，在 CAPM 下是有理论支撑的默认解，代价是天然携带动量偏差、在泡沫期放大被高估股票的权重。等权重、基本面加权、最小方差与各类 Smart Beta 则各自切断了权重与价格的某一条联系，把指数从&quot;中性&quot;推向某个特定方向——它们本质上是规则化的因子下注，而非&quot;更公平的指数&quot;。理解每种方法暴露了什么因子、付出多少换手与费率代价，是选择加权方案的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市值加权-被动投资的默认选择\">市值加权：被动投资的默认选择</h2><p>市值加权（Market-Capitalization Weighting）是全球绝大多数指数（S&amp;P 500、MSCI World、沪深 300 等）的标准加权方法。其逻辑极其简洁：每只股票在指数中的权重等于其市值占指数总市值的比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数学定义\">数学定义</h3><p>设指数包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 只股票，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 只股票的价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，流通股数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{P_i \\cdot S_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N} P_j \\cdot S_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6674em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"为什么市值加权是-自然-的\">为什么市值加权是&quot;自然&quot;的？</h3><p>市值加权的理论优雅性来自 CAPM（资本资产定价模型）的核心结论：</p>\n<p><strong>定理（两基金分离定理）</strong>：在 CAPM 假设下，所有理性投资者持有的风险资产组合都是<strong>市场组合</strong>——即市值加权组合。</p>\n<p>这意味着：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>市值加权组合是所有投资者的加权平均持仓</li>\n<li>它是唯一一个所有投资者可以同时持有而不产生&quot;谁在对手面&quot;问题的组合</li>\n<li>它具有<strong>自平衡</strong>性质——不需要主动调仓即可维持</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"市值加权的实践优势\">市值加权的实践优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零换手成本</td>\n<td>价格变动自动调整权重，无需交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高容量</td>\n<td>大市值股票自然获得高权重，避免流动性约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低跟踪成本</td>\n<td>指数调仓仅在成分股变更时发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论最优</td>\n<td>CAPM 下是均值-方差有效前沿上的切线组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反映市场共识</td>\n<td>价格包含所有投资者的信息聚合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"市值加权的已知缺陷\">市值加权的已知缺陷</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动量偏差</td>\n<td>过去涨幅大的股票权重更高——&quot;买贵卖贱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泡沫放大</td>\n<td>泡沫期高估值股票获得更高权重（如 2000 年科技股）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中度风险</td>\n<td>少数超大市值股可能主导指数（美股 Magnificent 7）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略基本面</td>\n<td>权重与盈利、分红、账面价值无关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[股价上涨] --&gt; B[市值增大]&#10;    B --&gt; C[指数权重提升]&#10;    C --&gt; D[被动资金更多买入]&#10;    D --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[股价上涨] --&gt; B[市值增大]\n    B --&gt; C[指数权重提升]\n    C --&gt; D[被动资金更多买入]\n    D --&gt; A</pre><p>这种正反馈循环在正常市场中是温和的，但在极端情况下可能加剧估值偏离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等权重加权\">等权重加权</h2><p>等权重（Equal Weighting）是最直观的替代方案——每只成分股分配相同权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"等权重的特征\">等权重的特征</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>等权重 vs 市值加权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小盘暴露</td>\n<td>显著更高——小盘股获得远超市值比例的权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换手率</td>\n<td>高——需要定期再平衡回到等权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分散化</td>\n<td>更高的有效分散化（Herfindahl 指数更低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>受限——小盘股流动性限制指数规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史收益</td>\n<td>S&amp;P 500 等权重长期跑赢市值加权约 2%/年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"等权重超额收益的来源\">等权重超额收益的来源</h3><p>等权重的超额收益主要来自两个因子暴露：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>小盘因子（SMB）</strong>：等权重系统性超配小盘股</li>\n<li><strong>再平衡溢价</strong>：逆向再平衡（卖出涨多的、买入跌多的）在均值回复市场中获利</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>再平衡溢价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{EW} - R_{MW} \\approx \\beta_{SMB} \\cdot R_{SMB} + \\text{再平衡溢价} - \\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">再平衡溢价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是更高的交易成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本面加权\">基本面加权</h2><p>基本面加权（Fundamental Weighting）由 Research Affiliates 的 Rob Arnott 在 2005 年系统提出（RAFI 指数）。其核心思想：用公司的经济&quot;足迹&quot;而非市场价格来决定权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"典型的基本面指标\">典型的基本面指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>营业收入</td>\n<td>过去 5 年平均营收</td>\n<td>反映经济规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金流</td>\n<td>过去 5 年平均经营现金流</td>\n<td>抗操纵性强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分红</td>\n<td>过去 5 年累计分红</td>\n<td>反映股东回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账面价值</td>\n<td>最近一期净资产</td>\n<td>反映存量资本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RAFI 综合指数通常取以上四个维度的等权重复合得分作为最终权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本面加权的理论争议\">基本面加权的理论争议</h3><p><strong>支持者观点（Arnott 2005）</strong>：</p>\n<p>市值加权系统性高配被高估的股票、低配被低估的股票。基本面加权通过切断权重与价格的直接联系，消除了&quot;买贵卖贱&quot;效应，获得约 2% 的年化超额收益。</p>\n<p><strong>反对者观点（Perold 2007, Asness 2006）</strong>：</p>\n<p>基本面加权的超额收益完全可以用价值因子（HML）解释。它本质上是一种价值倾斜策略，不是&quot;更好的指数化&quot;，而是一种系统性的主动下注。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{RAFI} - R_{MW} \\approx \\beta_{HML} \\cdot R_{HML} + \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"中国实践\">中国实践</h3><p>中证基本面系列指数（中证锐联基本面指数）在中国已运行多年：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>中证锐联基本面 50 指数（000925）：以 A 股基本面最大的 50 只股票为成分</li>\n<li>长期表现对比沪深 300 有一定超额，但波动性更高</li>\n<li>2026 年国内跟踪基本面指数的 ETF 规模仍较小（&lt;50 亿元），远不及主流宽基</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最小方差加权\">最小方差加权</h2><p>最小方差加权（Minimum Variance Weighting）的目标是构建给定成分股集合中方差最小的组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi></munder><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\mathbf{w}} \\quad \\mathbf{w}^T \\Sigma \\mathbf{w} \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\mathbf{w}^T \\mathbf{1} = 1, \\quad w_i \\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5913em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"最小方差组合的特性\">最小方差组合的特性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低波动异象</td>\n<td>历史上低波动股票风险调整后收益更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防御性</td>\n<td>在下跌市场中通常跑赢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度集中</td>\n<td>可能集中于少数低波动行业（公用事业、消费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对协方差估计敏感</td>\n<td>估计误差可能导致不稳定的权重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"经典产品\">经典产品</h3><ul>\n<li>MSCI Minimum Volatility Index：全球最流行的最小方差指数</li>\n<li>iShares MSCI Min Vol ETF（USMV）：美国规模最大的低波动 ETF</li>\n<li>华泰柏瑞中证红利低波动 ETF（512890）：中国市场的低波动策略代表</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"smart-beta-与-factor-tilt\">Smart Beta 与 Factor Tilt</h2><p>Smart Beta（聪明贝塔）是一个泛指替代加权策略的商业术语，核心思想是：<strong>在被动规则化框架内系统性暴露于特定风险因子</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主要-smart-beta-因子\">主要 Smart Beta 因子</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SB[Smart Beta] --&gt; V[价值&lt;br/&gt;Value]&#10;    SB --&gt; M[动量&lt;br/&gt;Momentum]&#10;    SB --&gt; S[规模&lt;br/&gt;Size]&#10;    SB --&gt; Q[质量&lt;br/&gt;Quality]&#10;    SB --&gt; LV[低波动&lt;br/&gt;Low Volatility]&#10;    SB --&gt; D[红利&lt;br/&gt;Dividend]\">graph TD\n    SB[Smart Beta] --&gt; V[价值&lt;br/&gt;Value]\n    SB --&gt; M[动量&lt;br/&gt;Momentum]\n    SB --&gt; S[规模&lt;br/&gt;Size]\n    SB --&gt; Q[质量&lt;br/&gt;Quality]\n    SB --&gt; LV[低波动&lt;br/&gt;Low Volatility]\n    SB --&gt; D[红利&lt;br/&gt;Dividend]</pre><h3 id=\"各因子策略对比\">各因子策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>学术来源</th>\n<th>经济逻辑</th>\n<th>中国代表指数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价值</td>\n<td>Fama-French 1993</td>\n<td>风险补偿/行为偏差</td>\n<td>中证价值回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动量</td>\n<td>Jegadeesh-Titman 1993</td>\n<td>反应不足/趋势延续</td>\n<td>中证动量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模</td>\n<td>Fama-French 1993</td>\n<td>流动性/信息不对称溢价</td>\n<td>中证 500/1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>Novy-Marx 2013</td>\n<td>盈利持续性溢价</td>\n<td>MSCI China A Quality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低波动</td>\n<td>Ang et al. 2006</td>\n<td>杠杆约束/彩票偏好</td>\n<td>中证红利低波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红利</td>\n<td>Miller-Modigliani 变体</td>\n<td>信号/纪律效应</td>\n<td>中证红利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"smart-beta-的局限性\">Smart Beta 的局限性</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>因子时序性</strong>：每个因子都有表现低迷期（价值因子 2017–2020 连续跑输）</li>\n<li><strong>拥挤风险</strong>：当资金大量涌入某一因子策略，预期收益下降</li>\n<li><strong>回测偏差</strong>：因子在发表后的表现通常弱于论文期间</li>\n<li><strong>费率溢价</strong>：Smart Beta ETF 费率（0.3%–0.6%）远高于纯市值加权（0.03%–0.15%）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"中国-smart-beta-市场现状-2026\">中国 Smart Beta 市场现状（2026）</h3><p>中国 Smart Beta ETF 市场仍处于发展初期：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>红利/低波动策略最受欢迎（华泰柏瑞红利低波 ETF 规模超 400 亿元）</li>\n<li>2025–2026 年自由现金流策略成为新热点（多只现金流 ETF 获批）</li>\n<li>多因子组合策略（同时暴露价值+质量+低波动）开始出现</li>\n<li>与美国市场相比，Smart Beta 在中国整体规模仍不足 ETF 总量的 10%</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"加权方法选择决策框架\">加权方法选择决策框架</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策维度</th>\n<th>市值加权</th>\n<th>等权重</th>\n<th>基本面加权</th>\n<th>最小方差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费率</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换手率</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论纯度</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（有争议）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子暴露</td>\n<td>大盘/动量</td>\n<td>小盘/再平衡</td>\n<td>价值</td>\n<td>低波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>核心配置</td>\n<td>小盘补充</td>\n<td>价值倾斜</td>\n<td>防御性配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><p>对于大多数个人投资者：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>核心仓位使用市值加权</strong>：费率最低、容量最大、理论最纯净</li>\n<li><strong>如果你相信某个因子</strong>：可以用小比例配置对应的 Smart Beta ETF</li>\n<li><strong>警惕&quot;因子动物园&quot;</strong>：学术界已发现 400+ 因子，绝大多数是数据挖掘产物</li>\n<li><strong>关注费率差异</strong>：如果 Smart Beta 相比市值加权多收 0.4% 年费，需要产生 &gt;0.4% 的年化超额才值得——这在费后很难持续实现</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键洞见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市值加权</td>\n<td>CAPM 理论最优 + 零换手 + 自平衡 = 默认最佳选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等权重</td>\n<td>本质是小盘+再平衡的因子暴露，不是&quot;更公平的指数&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基本面加权</td>\n<td>学术争论未决，可视为系统性价值倾斜策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小方差</td>\n<td>利用低波动异象，防御性强但集中度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smart Beta</td>\n<td>被动框架内的因子下注，费率和时序风险是核心考量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"市值加权与替代加权","id":"市值加权与替代加权"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"市值加权：被动投资的默认选择","id":"市值加权-被动投资的默认选择"},{"level":3,"text":"数学定义","id":"数学定义"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么市值加权是\"自然\"的？","id":"为什么市值加权是-自然-的"},{"level":3,"text":"市值加权的实践优势","id":"市值加权的实践优势"},{"level":3,"text":"市值加权的已知缺陷","id":"市值加权的已知缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"等权重加权","id":"等权重加权"},{"level":3,"text":"等权重的特征","id":"等权重的特征"},{"level":3,"text":"等权重超额收益的来源","id":"等权重超额收益的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"基本面加权","id":"基本面加权"},{"level":3,"text":"典型的基本面指标","id":"典型的基本面指标"},{"level":3,"text":"基本面加权的理论争议","id":"基本面加权的理论争议"},{"level":3,"text":"中国实践","id":"中国实践"},{"level":2,"text":"最小方差加权","id":"最小方差加权"},{"level":3,"text":"最小方差组合的特性","id":"最小方差组合的特性"},{"level":3,"text":"经典产品","id":"经典产品"},{"level":2,"text":"Smart Beta 与 Factor Tilt","id":"smart-beta-与-factor-tilt"},{"level":3,"text":"主要 Smart Beta 因子","id":"主要-smart-beta-因子"},{"level":3,"text":"各因子策略对比","id":"各因子策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Smart Beta 的局限性","id":"smart-beta-的局限性"},{"level":3,"text":"中国 Smart Beta 市场现状（2026）","id":"中国-smart-beta-市场现状-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"加权方法选择决策框架","id":"加权方法选择决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博格尔投资哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/bogle-philosophy"},"next":{"title":"跟踪误差与基金评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/tracking-error"}}